WEBVTT

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:30.756
We can actually replace some
of the biggest sources of the problem,

00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:34.796
oil, coal and gas,

00:00:34.836 --> 00:00:37.596
with something we have in abundance:

00:00:37.636 --> 00:00:38.796
wind.

00:00:39.596 --> 00:00:43.836
In my country, Denmark,
we are doing just that.

00:00:44.356 --> 00:00:47.756
Now we are a small country
with a small population.

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:50.596
If you haven't visited yet, please do so.

00:00:50.636 --> 00:00:53.396
We are all friendly people.

00:00:54.156 --> 00:00:56.876
As long as you don't criticize
our national football team.

00:00:56.916 --> 00:00:58.076
(Laughter)

00:00:58.916 --> 00:01:00.436
Nothing makes a Dane proud